{
  "schema-version": "1.0.0",
  "id": "water",
  "title": "Battle in the flooded grotto",
  "type": "game",
  "screen": {
    "type": "grid",
    "grid": {
      "rows": 12,
      "columns": 12
    }
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "combat",
      "type": "combat",
      "encounter": "water",
      "placement": {
        "row": 1,
        "column": 1,
        "rowSpan": 8,
        "columnSpan": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "instructions",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Water adds 10 exhaustion at turn start. At 60 exhaustion intensity 1 removes 1 AP and deals 3 fatigue damage; at 90 intensity 2 removes 2 AP and deals 6. E recovers, A stacks swimming rhythm, B resolves. S: Flow strike scales damage and costs. F: Reviving breath scales healing. G: Focus current grants intensity-based percentage bonuses. Z: Tidal bolt (water), X: Arc bolt (lightning), C: Venom dart (poison). Inspect the enemy's damage defenses. With Focus current (G), lightning damage siphons HP; actual healing reduces exhaustion. Click Brine bind to silence/disarm, Clear mind to prevent new controls, Shake off to cleanse, or Stunning bell to test stun immunity.",
      "placement": {
        "row": 1,
        "column": 10,
        "rowSpan": 6,
        "columnSpan": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "leave",
      "type": "button",
      "label": "Pause and return",
      "action": {
        "type": "enter-scene",
        "scene": "harbour"
      },
      "placement": {
        "row": 8,
        "column": 10,
        "columnSpan": 3
      }
    },
